# .mailmap: one canonical name and address per person, for `git shortlog` and mailmap-aware `git log`.
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
# See https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap. This changes how names are shown; it does not rewrite history.
# GitHub does not read this file; it cannot verify an email or change the contributor graph.
# New contributors: see contributors/README.md (a one-file mapping, not an edit here).

